    "faq_ai_scoring_answer": "The AI system analyzes submitted documents and user information to verify legitimacy of credit applications. It checks for document authenticity, cross-references user data, and assesses risk factors. The system provides a legality score and recommendation for admin approval.",
    "faq_farmer_docs": "What documents are required for farmer verification?",
    "faq_farmer_docs_answer": "Farmers need to provide: Land Certificate/Title Deed, Recent Farm Photos, Production Records (last 3 months), and Proof of Residence. All documents must be clear and legible.",
    "faq_create_listing": "How do I create a new credit listing?",
    "faq_create_listing_answer": "Go to Credit Sales > Create New Listing. Fill in the listing name, select sector, enter quantity and price per credit. Review the total value and publish. Credits will be available for buyer purchase immediately.",
    "faq_commission": "What are the commission rates?",
    "faq_commission_answer": "Commission rates vary by sector: Farmer (5%), Eco Stoves (6%), Hybrid Vehicles (4%), Commercial (7%). These are deducted from each sale automatically.",
    "faq_wallet_source": "Where do the credits in the admin wallet come from?",
    "faq_wallet_source_answer": "Credits in the admin wallet come from verified users who earn them through their activities (farming, eco stoves, etc.). The system collects these credits and stores them for management and resale.",
    "faq_payouts": "How are payouts distributed?",
    "faq_payouts_answer": "Payouts are distributed based on the sector contribution percentage and the fee structure. Monthly reconciliation ensures accurate distribution to all participating sectors.",
    "faq_manage_users": "How do I manage user accounts?",
    "faq_manage_users_answer": "In System Users, you can view all registered users, filter by sector and status, and perform actions like suspending or deleting accounts. Use the actions menu on each user row.",
    "faq_user_statuses": "What are the different user statuses?",
    "faq_user_statuses_answer": "Active: User is verified and can trade. Pending: Awaiting verification. Suspended: Account is restricted. Inactive: User hasn't been active in 60+ days.",
